## 4. QUALITY BAR
- Zero TypeScript errors.
- No console errors during the main booking flow.
- Money never a float. Balances never negative.
- Every API error returns a message key the UI can translate.
- UI looks designed: consistent spacing, one accent color used sparingly,
  real imagery on machine cards, no default browser styling visible.